gem piles, rock piles, dart piles, arrow piles, etc.  In other words,
if you add one item to a pile containing 255 items, you will have
a pile of 0 items.  I have not tested this explicitly, but I've never
been able to create a rock pile larger than 255 rocks.  Also I have
not verified this in the code.  BUT I bet you that if you stack your
diamonds in piles of 255 or less you will be ok.

